  {
   "name": "Superintendent search and leadership transition",
   "status": "settled",
   "summary": "Following the retirement announcement of Superintendent Edouard-Vincent in late 2024, the committee initiated a search for interim leadership to maintain continuity [M16, M19, M20]. Dr. Suzanne Galusi was appointed as interim superintendent and oversaw the transition while navigating complex contract and conflict-of-interest requirements [M19, M21, M23]. After an evaluation of her first year and a public strategic planning process regarding leadership priorities, the committee opted to forgo an external search and appointed Galusi as the permanent superintendent in February 2026 [M48, M49]. A final three-year contract for the permanent role was approved in May 2026 [M55].",
